## Project Scope

### In-Scope (MVP Deliverables)
- Web-based platform with gym search and profiles.
- Search gyms by name.
- Search by equipment or facility type.
- Display detailed gym profiles (equipment list, facilities, location/map).
- Admin panel for managing and updating gym data.
- Initial coverage limited to gyms within Riyadh.

### Out-of-Scope (Excluded from MVP)
- Mobile application in the first phase (planned for advanced stages).
- Expansion to other Saudi cities (planned later).
- Displaying gym memberships or subscription pricing.
- User reviews, ratings, or social features.
- Online booking or payment integration.
- Partnerships or advertisement integrations in the first release.

---

## Risks and Mitigation

| Risk                       | Description                                         | Mitigation Plan                                                                                     |
|----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **Data Accuracy**          | Gym information may become outdated or incorrect    | Establish admin verification processes and periodic reviews                                         |
| **Gym Participation**      | Gyms may be reluctant to share details              | Start with publicly available info; later form partnerships and offer incentives                    |
| **Scalability Challenges** | System may struggle with larger data when expanding | Design scalable architecture from the start and optimize databases                                  |
| **User Adoption**          | Users may not use the platform if value is unclear  | Focus on strong marketing and emphasize unique features (equipment-based search)                    |
| **Competition**            | Larger platforms may replicate the idea             | Build strong brand presence early and focus on local accuracy and detail                            |
| **User Expectation**       | Users may prefer a mobile app                       | Ensure web platform is fully responsive, mobile-friendly, and communicate roadmap for mobile launch |

---

## High-Level Plan

**Phase 1 – MVP Development**
- Design the web interface and database structure.
- Develop core search functionality (by gym name and equipment/facility).
- Implement gym profiles and admin panel.

**Phase 2 – Testing and Feedback**
- Conduct platform testing with target users.
- Collect feedback on usability and data accuracy.

**Phase 3 – Data Onboarding & Refinement**
- Add gyms in Riyadh and ensure accurate information.
- Optimize platform based on user feedback.

**Phase 4 – Scalability Planning**
- Prepare for future expansion to additional cities and sports facilities.
- Plan architecture for potential mobile app transition.

